<title>CANADA: SNC-Lavalin Group Inc Q1 profit rises.</title>
<headline>SNC-Lavalin Group Inc Q1 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			    1996</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.19		   C$0.15</p>
<p> Net			  8,581		    7,364</p>
<p> Revs		     288,567		  287,276</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  46,023		   47,950</p>
<p>	 (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: 1997 first-quarter earnings per share would have been C$0.17 if calculated on a pro forma basis using the actual number of shares issued and outstanding at March 31, 1997, thereby reflecting the full dilutive impact of the 4.4 million share issue of this March.</p>
